\item[S2] Andrej Dujella, Diophantine m-tuples, author-maintained survey (snapshot accessed 9 October 2026), Section 3.2, question preceding the examples D(256) and D(-255). \url{https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dujella/dujella.github.io/master/dn.html}.
